@* A citation that goes somewhere. It is an <a>, so it is followable and openable in a tab —
   which a span with a click handler is not. *@
<p class="w-[460px] text-sm leading-relaxed">
    The library reproduces shadcn's class strings exactly
    <a href="/components/button" class="align-middle">
        <Marker Variant="border"><MarkerContent>1</MarkerContent></Marker>
    </a>
    and generates them from its source
    <a href="/theming" class="align-middle">
        <Marker Variant="border"><MarkerContent>2</MarkerContent></Marker>
    </a>.
</p>
